Package: miadi-music-video
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: miadi-music-render (>= 0.1.0), miadi-music-measure (>= 0.1.0), imagemagick, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Music to picture on a Miadi host: score videos for an episode
 What an episode's music needs beyond an album track: the engraved score cut
 into frames under a scrolling playhead, composited with ImageMagick and
 Pillow, and muxed with its audio by ffmpeg into a clip the episode plays.
 An album-only host leaves this package out.
